  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing the Navbar**\n\nI\'m now focused on the `Navbar.tsx` component. My current thought is to include the PositivusLogo and a set of navigation links: \"About us\", \"Services\", \"Use Cases\", \"Pricing\", and \"Blog\". I\'m considering using either direct links or smooth scrolling for the navigation. Finally, there will be an \"Explore\" button.\n\n\n**Designing the Hero Section**\n\nNow I\'m diving into the `Hero.tsx` component. My focus is on a two-column layout. On the left, I\'m thinking of a title, a brief description, and a \"Get Started\" button. The right side will feature a captivating HeroIllustration with a megaphone, orbiting rings, starbursts, and floating lime spheres. I\'m aiming for an impactful visual contrast.\n\n\n**Defining the Cards**\n\nI\'m now detailing the structure of six service cards to showcase. They\'ll be organized in two columns (or one on smaller screens). Each card will have a distinct background, border, and box-shadow. I\'m carefully considering the headings, which will use two-line subtitles within badges of varying colors, and I\'m designing the \"Learn More\" call-to-action with arrows, and each will be paired with a unique illustration that captures the essence of the service.\n\n\n**Detailing the Service Cards**\n\nI\'ve just finalized the specifications for the remaining three service cards, wrapping up the set of six. I\'ve chosen distinct color palettes for each card, incorporating backgrounds, borders, and box shadows. Each card now has its own unique illustration: Email, Content, and Analytics-themed visuals. The \"Learn More\" call to action is consistent, with a dark circle, green arrow, and white text. Badges and two-line subtitles define each heading.\n\n\n**Finalizing the CTA Banner**\n\nI\'m now detailing the `CtaBanner.tsx` component. I\'ve designed the background and border-radius, added padding, and I\'m configuring the left section, which includes a heading, paragraph, and a \"Get Started\" button with a dark background and white text. I\'ve also added the corresponding illustration.\n\nI\'m now onto the `CaseStudies.tsx` component. I\'m focusing on defining a section heading, followed by a card with a specific background, border-radius, and padding, with three columns separated by white divider lines that include a \"Learn More\" link with a green diagonal arrow.\n\n\n**Defining the Accordion**\n\nI\'m now detailing the `WorkingProcess.tsx` component. I\'m building a section heading followed by six accordion cards. Each card will have an active and inactive state, with distinct visual cues. The active state will feature a green background, a border, a box-shadow, and a minus button to collapse, while inactive cards will have a light background, border, box-shadow, and a plus button to expand.\n\n**Constructing the Team Section**\n\nI\'m now structuring the `Team.tsx` component. This section will feature a heading and six cards arranged in a responsive grid. Each card will showcase a team member with an avatar (sporting a flower sprocket mask and a green tint) with name, role, a LinkedIn button, a divider, and a bio. Finally, an \"Explore\" button at the bottom completes the section.\n\n\n**Designing Testimonials**\n\nI\'m now detailing the `Testimonials.tsx` component. My focus is on creating a dark container with rounded borders and padding, featuring a speech bubble design, quote, author, role, and slider navigation. The speech bubble will have a unique tail. I am thinking of using green and white colors. The slider\'s navigation will include Prev/Next arrows and star indicators.\n\n**Crafting the Contact Section**\n\nI\'m moving on to the `ContactSection.tsx` component. I\'m focusing on a card-based layout, with a light gray background and rounded borders. It includes radio selectors for \"Say Hi\" and \"Get a Quote\", input fields for name and email, and a textarea for the message. I\'m aiming for a clean and user-friendly design.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_708246"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\nimport { PositivusLogo } from \'./PositivusIcons\';\\n\\ninterface NavbarProps {\\n  onQuoteClick?: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const Navbar: React.FC<NavbarProps> = ({ onQuoteClick }) => {\\n  const [mobileMenuOpen, setMobileMenuOpen] = useState(false);\\n\\n  const navLinks = [\\n    { label: \'About us\', href: \'#about\' },\\n    { label: \'Services\', href: \'#services\' },\\n    { label: \'Use Cases\', href: \'#cases\' },\\n    { label: \'Pricing\', href: \'#process\' },\\n    { label: \'Blog\', href: \'#team\' },\\n  ];\\n\\n  return (\\n    <header className=\\\"w-full bg-white relative z-50\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-6 sm:py-8 flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n        {/* Logo */}\\n        <a href=\\\"#\\\" className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\" aria-label=\\\"Positivus Home\\\">\\n          <PositivusLogo />\\n        </a>\\n\\n        {/* Desktop Navigation Links & Action Button */}\\n        <div className=\\\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-10\\\">\\n          <nav className=\\\"flex items-center gap-8\\\">\\n            {navLinks.map((link, idx) => (\\n              <a\\n                key={idx}\\n                href={link.href}\\n                className=\\\"font-[\'Space_Grotesk\'] text-[18px] lg:text-[20px] text-black font-normal hover:text-[#B9FF66] transition-colors duration-150 whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n              >\\n                {link.label}\\n              </a>\\n            ))}\\n          </nav>\\n\\n          {/* Action Button: Dark border, rounded 14px, padding 20px 35px */}\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onQuoteClick}\\n            className=\\\"font-[\'Space_Grotesk\'] text-[18px] lg:text-[20px] font-normal text-black border border-[#191A23] rounded-[14px] px-[35px] py-[18px] hover:bg-[#191A23] hover:text-white transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n          >\\n            Learn More\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Mobile Hamburger Toggle */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex lg:hidden items-center\\\">\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => setMobileMenuOpen(!mobileMenuOpen)}\\n            className=\\\"p-2 text-black hover:text-[#191A23] focus:outline-none cursor-pointer\\\"\\n            aria-label=\\\"Toggle navigation menu\\\"\\n          >\\n            <svg width=\\\"28\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" strokeWidth=\\\"2.5\\\">\\n              {mobileMenuOpen ? (\\n                <path strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\" strokeLinejoin=\\\"round\\\" d=\\\"M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12\\\" />\\n              ) : (\\n                <path strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\" strokeLinejoin=\\\"round\\\" d=\\\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\\\" />\\n              )}\\n            </svg>\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Mobile Drawer */}\\n      {mobileMenuOpen && (\\n        <div className=\\\"lg:hidden bg-white border-b border-[#191A23]/10 px-6 py-6 shadow-xl\\\">\\n          <nav className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-4\\\">\\n            {navLinks.map((link, idx) => (\\n              <a\\n                key={idx}\\n                href={link.href}\\n                onClick={() => setMobileMenuOpen(false)}\\n                className=\\\"font-[\'Space_Grotesk\'] text-[20px] text-black font-medium py-2 border-b border-gray-100\\\"\\n              >\\n                {link.label}\\n              </a>\\n            ))}\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => {\\n                setMobileMenuOpen(false);\\n                if (onQuoteClick) onQuoteClick();\\n              }}\\n              className=\\\"mt-4 font-[\'Space_Grotesk\'] text-[18px] font-medium text-black border border-[#191A23] rounded-[14px] px-6 py-4 text-center hover:bg-[#191A23] hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n            >\\n              Learn More\\n            </button>\\n          </nav>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n    </header>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create responsive Navbar matching Positivus layout and typography\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/Navbar.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing Navbar component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create Navbar.tsx\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\236H\n\233H\001i\024}\023&D\242\032\267s\\\200\315\350H\336\374\260\225>\005\361L NR\261Y\273\\\267\346\346\017\316\360\365y\024\2674\366\030\266\203`+\373D\326\311\3667\027\316n\207\2442`U\255X\314\361\276\363\v\377\236\016},\315\375 Tlae\316\277]\367\244D#\302U\267\247\035\345\001\026\0037\264&\211TJ\222Z\302\362\311\207\032>\226\330\246K\301]\213l\262.-.\247\361d\337m\307\025\177\273Kz\242+?rV\fh\213\003aH4\237\322\020\227\303\037\362\375h\317\000Bj\232\001vO\271{\023l\325\024P\270\234\021\n+\275\325\331\360\201\261\240\021\241\tU\354\375\207\266\366\356Y\376Yj\033\207\373qj3@\037XU\\\343\204gQ\276W\017H\276\276\031\304\215{\262\213(\032H\307\254UC\305\261\333\230\240\255\202\251q\210\233=\256m\261\035\320\260\340\004\022K\374\251I\316\201\300\2700e\232\001\205\200\006\266\312[\322\370\347\270oapA\025k\340R|TS\246\313\364\356\217;\026Z\315r9\003 O\266y\321\270\037;)\024\340\232b{\225\235\214\254r\362\035_`\220\322O\245\0253\'b\am\246\317=\233\004<\302\311wH\254v\211\322f5\230\tXv\332\306\a\207\255\333p\251\2352\337\020\354\"\225J5#\201\344\246k\252\234X\345QJY\346xa\310YF\314J\325[a\037E\275\260\034\352\375\207\311h2\326G\267\307~%Z\033i\230\377\220\024\360\230\\\021H\250\v\364\315\267\236L\v\034TD\240\004F\277\223\337\3515\363\rJ\032o\326\261\371\b\250\363[\206\\\247\314\200%\361\320\324\363j\220\366\375\341\303\202\257-\345l\363\377\255>:|b\300\330\255:D\306\023\031|\203J\a\305\303a\272\'\376\3511@\300\b6b\264\225\264uN-I\006E\335=\210V\252Kd\256;\222\021\245\312\235\262M/-?\030\311\271\373\371\327~z\006\355\270\237\274\003@\340\367\353\267\365\304j\355\250T&\362\376\336\335\362\223z%\200 \277\357\246\344<H\2055\336\217\255\354\221d\024+\b*x\233\023{uL\n\361\256\r\\\336\215\000\022\261\260\362EI\372\203\377\003XXX\212\332\022z\244\222\260\211\277\272V\245~\221\345/Z\006\004\030\036\2211\255`\303\217D\344\265\215\312@Z1\257U\261\3141Q\242\224\322_\024\226\276z\266\271{w\031\016\266gSZ\355u\v\246\216B\257?\203\262(\376\221\200%\305