  planner_response {
    response: "T\303\264i \304\221\303\243 ho\303\240n th\303\240nh vi\341\273\207c t\303\241i t\341\272\241o landing page theo ch\303\255nh x\303\241c thi\341\272\277t k\341\272\277 **Positivus** t\341\273\253 CSS, SVG v\303\240 quy t\341\272\257c thay th\341\272\277 v\304\203n b\341\272\243n \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c cung c\341\272\245p:\n\n### 1. \304\220\341\273\231 ch\303\255nh x\303\241c thi\341\272\277t k\341\272\277 & Design System\n- **M\303\240u s\341\272\257c & Tokens**: \n  - Primary Green: `#B9FF66`\n  - Dark Neutral: `#191A23`\n  - Grey Surface: `#F3F3F3`\n  - Secondary Dark: `#292A32` & `#21241D`\n- **Typography**: \304\220\303\243 t\303\255ch h\341\273\243p font chu\341\272\251n **Space Grotesk** (`400`, `500`, `700`) v\341\273\233i \304\221\341\272\247y \304\221\341\273\247 ph\303\242n c\341\272\245p hi\341\273\203n th\341\273\213 (60px, 40px, 30px, 20px, 18px).\n- **Quy c\303\241ch h\303\254nh kh\341\273\221i & hi\341\273\207u \341\273\251ng**:\n  - Border-radius th\341\272\273: `45px`\n  - Border-radius n\303\272t: `14px`\n  - Border-radius nh\303\243n ti\303\252u \304\221\341\273\201: `7px`\n  - Signature drop-shadow: `0px 5px 0px #191A23`\n\n### 2. C\341\272\245u tr\303\272c c\303\241c Section theo \304\221\303\272ng th\341\273\251 t\341\273\261 b\341\272\243n v\341\272\275\n1. **Navigation Bar**: Logo Positivus v\341\273\233i bi\341\273\203u t\306\260\341\273\243ng ng\303\264i sao 4 c\303\241nh, menu li\303\252n k\341\272\277t v\303\240 n\303\272t h\303\240nh \304\221\341\273\231ng v\341\273\233i vi\341\273\201n t\341\273\221i 1px.\n2. **Hero Header**: Ti\303\252u \304\221\341\273\201 \"Title\", \304\221o\341\272\241n m\303\264 t\341\272\243 Lorem Ipsum, n\303\272t \"Get Started\", c\303\271ng \304\221\341\273\223 h\341\273\215a vector loa ph\303\241t thanh (megaphone) v\341\273\233i c\303\241c v\303\240nh qu\341\273\271 \304\221\341\272\241o elip nghi\303\252ng `28.88deg`, ng\303\264i sao v\303\240 h\341\272\241t c\341\272\247u xanh.\n3. **Logotypes**: D\341\272\243i logo th\306\260\306\241ng hi\341\273\207u \304\221\341\273\221i t\303\241c (Amazon, Dribbble, HubSpot, Notion, Netflix, Zoom) chu\341\272\251n \304\221\341\273\231 m\341\273\235 v\303\240 hi\341\273\207u \341\273\251ng t\306\260\306\241ng t\303\241c.\n4. **Services Block**: 6 th\341\272\273 d\341\273\213ch v\341\273\245 v\341\273\233i ph\341\273\221i m\303\240u lu\303\242n phi\303\252n chu\341\272\251n x\303\241c (`#F3F3F3`, `#B9FF66`, `#191A23`), nh\303\243n ti\303\252u \304\221\341\273\201 2 d\303\262ng \"Subtitle\", n\303\272t m\305\251i t\303\252n ch\303\251o v\303\240 h\303\254nh minh h\341\273\215a vector chuy\303\252n bi\341\273\207t.\n5. **CTA Proposal Banner**: Th\341\272\273 bo tr\303\262n 45px v\341\273\233i minh h\341\273\215a h\303\254nh h\341\273\215c \304\221\341\273\223ng t\303\242m, ti\303\252u \304\221\341\273\201 \"Subtitle\", \304\221o\341\272\241n v\304\203n b\341\272\243n v\303\240 n\303\272t h\303\240nh \304\221\341\273\231ng.\n6. **Case Studies**: Kh\341\273\221i n\341\273\201n t\341\273\221i bo tr\303\262n 45px chia 3 c\341\273\231t ng\304\203n c\303\241ch b\341\273\237i \304\221\306\260\341\273\235ng k\341\272\273 tr\341\272\257ng d\341\273\215c, \304\221o\341\272\241n v\304\203n b\341\272\243n m\303\264 t\341\272\243 v\303\240 li\303\252n k\341\272\277t \"Learn More\" k\303\250m m\305\251i t\303\252n xanh.\n7. **Working Process (Accordion 01 - 06)**: C\303\241c b\306\260\341\273\233c t\341\273\253 01 \304\221\341\272\277n 06 c\303\263 kh\341\272\243 n\304\203ng \304\221\303\263ng/m\341\273\237 t\306\260\306\241ng t\303\241c, b\306\260\341\273\233c active \304\221\341\273\225i sang n\341\273\201n xanh `#B9FF66` v\341\273\233i icon `-`, c\303\241c b\306\260\341\273\233c c\303\262n l\341\272\241i n\341\273\201n x\303\241m `#F3F3F3` v\341\273\233i icon `+`.\n8. **Team**: 6 th\341\272\273 th\303\240nh vi\303\252n v\341\273\233i \341\272\243nh \304\221\341\272\241i di\341\273\207n c\303\263 m\341\272\267t n\341\272\241 b\303\241nh r\304\203ng hoa (flower sprocket mask) ph\341\273\221i m\303\240u duotone xanh l\303\241, t\303\252n \"Subtitle\", ch\341\273\251c danh \"Subtitle\", n\303\272t LinkedIn tr\303\262n v\303\240 n\303\272t \"Learn More\".\n9. **Testimonials**: Kh\341\273\221i t\341\273\221i ch\341\273\251a khung bong b\303\263ng h\341\273\231i tho\341\272\241i c\303\263 \304\221u\303\264i tr\341\273\217 xu\341\273\221ng vi\341\273\201n tr\341\272\257ng/xanh, tr\303\255ch d\341\272\253n Lorem Ipsum, t\303\252n t\303\241c gi\341\272\243 v\303\240 b\341\273\231 \304\221i\341\273\201u khi\341\273\203n slide v\341\273\233i 5 ng\303\264i sao ch\341\273\211 th\341\273\213.\n10. **Contact Us**: Form li\303\252n h\341\273\207 n\341\273\201n x\303\241m v\341\273\233i radio t\303\271y ch\341\273\215n \"Say Hi\" / \"Get a Quote\" (ch\341\272\245m xanh active), c\303\241c tr\306\260\341\273\235ng nh\341\272\255p li\341\273\207u (Name, Email, Message) v\303\240 h\303\254nh minh h\341\273\215a h\303\254nh h\341\273\215c.\n11. **Footer**: Ch\303\242n trang n\341\273\201n t\341\273\221i bo tr\303\262n 2 g\303\263c tr\303\252n, logo tr\341\272\257ng, li\303\252n k\341\272\277t g\341\272\241ch ch\303\242n, bi\341\273\203u t\306\260\341\273\243ng m\341\272\241ng x\303\243 h\341\273\231i tr\303\262n, kh\341\273\221i \304\221\304\203ng k\303\275 nh\341\272\255n tin `#292A32`, \304\221\306\260\341\273\235ng k\341\272\273 tr\341\272\257ng v\303\240 th\303\264ng tin b\341\272\243n quy\341\273\201n.\n\n### 3. Quy t\341\272\257c thay th\341\272\277 v\304\203n b\341\272\243n \304\221\303\243 tu\303\242n th\341\273\247 nghi\303\252m ng\341\272\267t\n- Ti\303\252u \304\221\341\273\201 ch\303\255nh: **\"Title\"**\n- Ti\303\252u \304\221\341\273\201 section: **\"Section Title\"**\n- Ti\303\252u \304\221\341\273\201 ph\341\273\245/nh\341\273\217: **\"Subtitle\"**\n- N\341\273\231i dung \304\221o\341\272\241n v\304\203n: **Lorem Ipsum** b\341\272\243o to\303\240n \304\221\341\273\231 d\303\240i v\303\240 m\341\272\255t \304\221\341\273\231 tr\341\273\261c quan.\n- N\303\272t b\341\272\245m: **\"Get Started\"** / **\"Learn More\"**"
    thinking: "**Verifying System Integrity**\n\nI\'m pleased to report that the initial TypeScript compilation passed without errors using `--noEmit`. Now, I\'m shifting focus to verify user requirements and confirm design fidelity. The primary goal here is to reconstruct the original visual system with the lime green color, `#B9FF66`, preserved. I\'m checking the design against the checklist to ensure alignment with the initial specifications.\n\n\n**Confirming Aesthetic Consistency**\n\nI\'ve just finalized the color palette integration, ensuring that the dark black, light grey, and footer card dark colors are precisely implemented alongside white and black. I\'ve also verified the typography, including the `Space Grotesk` font with all specified sizes, weights, and line heights. Spacing, border-radius, button radius, and badge radius have been reconfirmed, as have the drop shadows.\n\n\n**Detailing Specific Block Elements**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into the specific elements within each block, like the masked flower sprocket avatars, duotone green filters, and the \"See All Team\" button. I am paying close attention to the testimonials block, including the dark container, speech bubbles, and pagination. I\'m also examining the contact block, especially the custom radio buttons, and the footer, including the logo and social circles.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "T\303\264i \304\221\303\243 ho\303\240n th\303\240nh vi\341\273\207c t\303\241i t\341\272\241o landing page theo ch\303\255nh x\303\241c thi\341\272\277t k\341\272\277 **Positivus** t\341\273\253 CSS, SVG v\303\240 quy t\341\272\257c thay th\341\272\277 v\304\203n b\341\272\243n \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c cung c\341\272\245p:\n\n### 1. \304\220\341\273\231 ch\303\255nh x\303\241c thi\341\272\277t k\341\272\277 & Design System\n- **M\303\240u s\341\272\257c & Tokens**: \n  - Primary Green: `#B9FF66`\n  - Dark Neutral: `#191A23`\n  - Grey Surface: `#F3F3F3`\n  - Secondary Dark: `#292A32` & `#21241D`\n- **Typography**: \304\220\303\243 t\303\255ch h\341\273\243p font chu\341\272\251n **Space Grotesk** (`400`, `500`, `700`) v\341\273\233i \304\221\341\272\247y \304\221\341\273\247 ph\303\242n c\341\272\245p hi\341\273\203n th\341\273\213 (60px, 40px, 30px, 20px, 18px).\n- **Quy c\303\241ch h\303\254nh kh\341\273\221i & hi\341\273\207u \341\273\251ng**:\n  - Border-radius th\341\272\273: `45px`\n  - Border-radius n\303\272t: `14px`\n  - Border-radius nh\303\243n ti\303\252u \304\221\341\273\201: `7px`\n  - Signature drop-shadow: `0px 5px 0px #191A23`\n\n### 2. C\341\272\245u tr\303\272c c\303\241c Section theo \304\221\303\272ng th\341\273\251 t\341\273\261 b\341\272\243n v\341\272\275\n1. **Navigation Bar**: Logo Positivus v\341\273\233i bi\341\273\203u t\306\260\341\273\243ng ng\303\264i sao 4 c\303\241nh, menu li\303\252n k\341\272\277t v\303\240 n\303\272t h\303\240nh \304\221\341\273\231ng v\341\273\233i vi\341\273\201n t\341\273\221i 1px.\n2. **Hero Header**: Ti\303\252u \304\221\341\273\201 \"Title\", \304\221o\341\272\241n m\303\264 t\341\272\243 Lorem Ipsum, n\303\272t \"Get Started\", c\303\271ng \304\221\341\273\223 h\341\273\215a vector loa ph\303\241t thanh (megaphone) v\341\273\233i c\303\241c v\303\240nh qu\341\273\271 \304\221\341\272\241o elip nghi\303\252ng `28.88deg`, ng\303\264i sao v\303\240 h\341\272\241t c\341\272\247u xanh.\n3. **Logotypes**: D\341\272\243i logo th\306\260\306\241ng hi\341\273\207u \304\221\341\273\221i t\303\241c (Amazon, Dribbble, HubSpot, Notion, Netflix, Zoom) chu\341\272\251n \304\221\341\273\231 m\341\273\235 v\303\240 hi\341\273\207u \341\273\251ng t\306\260\306\241ng t\303\241c.\n4. **Services Block**: 6 th\341\272\273 d\341\273\213ch v\341\273\245 v\341\273\233i ph\341\273\221i m\303\240u lu\303\242n phi\303\252n chu\341\272\251n x\303\241c (`#F3F3F3`, `#B9FF66`, `#191A23`), nh\303\243n ti\303\252u \304\221\341\273\201 2 d\303\262ng \"Subtitle\", n\303\272t m\305\251i t\303\252n ch\303\251o v\303\240 h\303\254nh minh h\341\273\215a vector chuy\303\252n bi\341\273\207t.\n5. **CTA Proposal Banner**: Th\341\272\273 bo tr\303\262n 45px v\341\273\233i minh h\341\273\215a h\303\254nh h\341\273\215c \304\221\341\273\223ng t\303\242m, ti\303\252u \304\221\341\273\201 \"Subtitle\", \304\221o\341\272\241n v\304\203n b\341\272\243n v\303\240 n\303\272t h\303\240nh \304\221\341\273\231ng.\n6. **Case Studies**: Kh\341\273\221i n\341\273\201n t\341\273\221i bo tr\303\262n 45px chia 3 c\341\273\231t ng\304\203n c\303\241ch b\341\273\237i \304\221\306\260\341\273\235ng k\341\272\273 tr\341\272\257ng d\341\273\215c, \304\221o\341\272\241n v\304\203n b\341\272\243n m\303\264 t\341\272\243 v\303\240 li\303\252n k\341\272\277t \"Learn More\" k\303\250m m\305\251i t\303\252n xanh.\n7. **Working Process (Accordion 01 - 06)**: C\303\241c b\306\260\341\273\233c t\341\273\253 01 \304\221\341\272\277n 06 c\303\263 kh\341\272\243 n\304\203ng \304\221\303\263ng/m\341\273\237 t\306\260\306\241ng t\303\241c, b\306\260\341\273\233c active \304\221\341\273\225i sang n\341\273\201n xanh `#B9FF66` v\341\273\233i icon `-`, c\303\241c b\306\260\341\273\233c c\303\262n l\341\272\241i n\341\273\201n x\303\241m `#F3F3F3` v\341\273\233i icon `+`.\n8. **Team**: 6 th\341\272\273 th\303\240nh vi\303\252n v\341\273\233i \341\272\243nh \304\221\341\272\241i di\341\273\207n c\303\263 m\341\272\267t n\341\272\241 b\303\241nh r\304\203ng hoa (flower sprocket mask) ph\341\273\221i m\303\240u duotone xanh l\303\241, t\303\252n \"Subtitle\", ch\341\273\251c danh \"Subtitle\", n\303\272t LinkedIn tr\303\262n v\303\240 n\303\272t \"Learn More\".\n9. **Testimonials**: Kh\341\273\221i t\341\273\221i ch\341\273\251a khung bong b\303\263ng h\341\273\231i tho\341\272\241i c\303\263 \304\221u\303\264i tr\341\273\217 xu\341\273\221ng vi\341\273\201n tr\341\272\257ng/xanh, tr\303\255ch d\341\272\253n Lorem Ipsum, t\303\252n t\303\241c gi\341\272\243 v\303\240 b\341\273\231 \304\221i\341\273\201u khi\341\273\203n slide v\341\273\233i 5 ng\303\264i sao ch\341\273\211 th\341\273\213.\n10. **Contact Us**: Form li\303\252n h\341\273\207 n\341\273\201n x\303\241m v\341\273\233i radio t\303\271y ch\341\273\215n \"Say Hi\" / \"Get a Quote\" (ch\341\272\245m xanh active), c\303\241c tr\306\260\341\273\235ng nh\341\272\255p li\341\273\207u (Name, Email, Message) v\303\240 h\303\254nh minh h\341\273\215a h\303\254nh h\341\273\215c.\n11. **Footer**: Ch\303\242n trang n\341\273\201n t\341\273\221i bo tr\303\262n 2 g\303\263c tr\303\252n, logo tr\341\272\257ng, li\303\252n k\341\272\277t g\341\272\241ch ch\303\242n, bi\341\273\203u t\306\260\341\273\243ng m\341\272\241ng x\303\243 h\341\273\231i tr\303\262n, kh\341\273\221i \304\221\304\203ng k\303\275 nh\341\272\255n tin `#292A32`, \304\221\306\260\341\273\235ng k\341\272\273 tr\341\272\257ng v\303\240 th\303\264ng tin b\341\272\243n quy\341\273\201n.\n\n### 3. Quy t\341\272\257c thay th\341\272\277 v\304\203n b\341\272\243n \304\221\303\243 tu\303\242n th\341\273\247 nghi\303\252m ng\341\272\267t\n- Ti\303\252u \304\221\341\273\201 ch\303\255nh: **\"Title\"**\n- Ti\303\252u \304\221\341\273\201 section: **\"Section Title\"**\n- Ti\303\252u \304\221\341\273\201 ph\341\273\245/nh\341\273\217: **\"Subtitle\"**\n- N\341\273\231i dung \304\221o\341\272\241n v\304\203n: **Lorem Ipsum** b\341\272\243o to\303\240n \304\221\341\273\231 d\303\240i 