  planner_response {
    response: "\304\220\303\243 ho\303\240n th\303\240nh \304\221\341\272\247y \304\221\341\273\247 t\341\272\245t c\341\272\243 c\303\241c thay \304\221\341\273\225i theo y\303\252u c\341\272\247u c\341\273\247a b\341\272\241n:\n\n1. **Thay \304\221\341\273\225i th\306\260\306\241ng hi\341\273\207u \"Positivus\" th\303\240nh \"Namind\"**:\n   - \304\220\303\243 b\341\273\217 ho\303\240n to\303\240n bi\341\273\203u t\306\260\341\273\243ng phi ti\303\252u/ng\303\264i sao 4 c\303\241nh.\n   - Hi\341\273\203n th\341\273\213 wordmark ch\341\273\257 **Namind** tinh t\341\272\277 v\303\240 n\341\273\225i b\341\272\255t \341\273\237 c\341\272\243 thanh \304\221i\341\273\201u h\306\260\341\273\233ng (header) v\303\240 ch\303\242n trang (footer).\n\n2. **Chuy\341\273\203n to\303\240n b\341\273\231 h\303\240ng sponsor th\303\240nh b\341\272\243ng LED ch\341\273\257 ch\341\272\241y ngang**:\n   - Thay th\341\272\277 to\303\240n b\341\273\231 h\303\240ng logo \304\221\341\273\221i t\303\241c b\341\272\261ng m\341\273\231t b\341\272\243ng LED \304\221i\341\273\207n t\341\273\255 n\341\273\201n t\341\273\221i `#191A23` v\341\273\233i hi\341\273\207u \341\273\251ng ch\341\272\241y ngang li\303\252n t\341\273\245c (infinite marquee ticker).\n   - N\341\273\231i dung hi\341\273\203n th\341\273\213: *\"Th\341\273\255 th\303\241ch tr\306\260c ti\341\272\277p! 2 ng\303\240y Affiliate 100 tri\341\273\207u/ th\303\241ng ch\341\273\211 b\341\272\261ng chi\341\272\277c \304\221i\341\273\207n tho\341\272\241i\"* c\303\271ng c\303\241c ch\341\272\245m LED ph\303\241t s\303\241ng.\n\n3. **C\341\272\255p nh\341\272\255t ti\303\252u \304\221\341\273\201 Hero Section v\341\273\233i ng\341\272\257t d\303\262ng chu\341\272\251n x\303\241c**:\n   - **D\303\262ng 1**: `TH\341\273\254 TH\303\201CH 2 NG\303\200Y - D\303\222NG TI\341\273\200N 100 TRI\341\273\206U/ TH\303\201NG T\341\273\252 AFFILIATE`\n   - **D\303\262ng 2**: `ch\341\273\211 c\341\272\247n Bi\341\272\277t B\341\272\245m \304\220i\341\273\207n Tho\341\272\241i (MI\341\273\204N PH\303\215)`\n\n4. **Chuy\341\273\203n Bottom Bar th\303\240nh Topbar n\341\272\261m ngay tr\303\252n Navbar**:\n   - Thanh m\303\240u `#B9FF66` n\341\273\225i b\341\272\255t v\341\273\233i n\303\272t *\"Gi\341\273\257 ch\341\273\227 ngay\"* \304\221\303\243 \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c \304\221\306\260a l\303\252n v\341\273\213 tr\303\255 cao nh\341\272\245t tr\303\252n c\303\271ng website (n\341\272\261m tr\341\273\261c ti\341\272\277p b\303\252n tr\303\252n Navbar/topbar ch\303\255nh).\n   - \304\220\303\243 g\341\273\241 b\341\273\217 thanh \304\221\303\241y (bottom bar) \304\221\341\273\203 giao di\341\273\207n tho\303\241ng s\341\272\241ch v\303\240 \304\221\303\272ng b\341\273\221 c\341\273\245c b\341\272\241n mong mu\341\273\221n."
    thinking: "**Verifying prompt compliance**\n\nI\'m pleased to report that the applet\'s build and lint checks are now clean. I\'ve now cross-referenced all requirements against the current state, and I have addressed the request to replace the dart/star icon with \"Namind\" text, completely removing the icon.\n\n\n"
