  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Hero Component**\n\nOkay, I\'m currently working on building an interactive form directly within the `Hero.tsx` component. I\'ve got the state figured out \342\200\223 it will include `name`, `phone`, `email` (all strings), and a `submitted` boolean. The main task now is to ensure the form validates properly on submission, requiring either a phone number or an email address to be entered.\n\n\n**Implementing Confirmation UI**\n\nI\'ve integrated the confirmation message: \"\304\220\303\243 gi\341\273\257 ch\341\273\227 th\303\240nh c\303\264ng! V\303\251 mi\341\273\205n ph\303\255 s\341\272\275 \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c g\341\273\255i cho b\341\272\241n.\" It\342\200\231s styled precisely with the Positivus design system, including the input boxes with rounded borders, and the submit button with its unique hover effect. The sub-text, \"th\303\264ng tin c\341\273\247a b\341\272\241n \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c b\341\272\243o m\341\272\255t tuy\341\273\207t \304\221\341\273\221i,\" is also included.\n\n\n**Refining Headline Elements**\n\nI\'m now focusing on refining the headline\'s text hierarchy and styling. I\'ve broken down the text into distinct spans to manage the varying font sizes, boldness, and spacing more effectively. I\'m leveraging `tracking-tight` and `uppercase` to enhance visual appeal. The plan is to implement the sub-title, the inputs and button, and the subtext below the button.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_607461"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\n\\nexport const Hero: React.FC = () => {\\n  const [formData, setFormData] = useState({\\n    name: \'\',\\n    phone: \'\',\\n    email: \'\',\\n  });\\n  const [isSuccess, setIsSuccess] = useState(false);\\n\\n  const handleSubmit = (e: React.FormEvent) => {\\n    e.preventDefault();\\n    if (!formData.name && !formData.phone && !formData.email) return;\\n    setIsSuccess(true);\\n    setTimeout(() => {\\n      setIsSuccess(false);\\n      setFormData({ name: \'\', phone: \'\', email: \'\' });\\n    }, 4500);\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <section id=\\\"hero-register\\\" className=\\\"w-full pt-4 pb-12 sm:pt-8 sm:pb-16 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-col-reverse lg:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-10 lg:gap-12\\\">\\n          {/* Left Block: Title, Subtitle, Form */}\\n          <div className=\\\"w-full lg:max-w-[580px] flex flex-col items-start gap-5 sm:gap-6\\\">\\n            {/* Title (All uppercase) */}\\n            <h1 className=\\\"font-[\'Space_Grotesk\'] font-bold text-[28px] sm:text-[36px] lg:text-[42px] leading-[36px] sm:leading-[46px] lg:leading-[52px] text-black tracking-tight uppercase\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"block\\\">\\n                TH\341\273\254 TH\303\201CH 2 NG\303\200Y MI\341\273\204N PH\303\215 - B\303\215 M\341\272\254T\\n              </span>\\n              <span className=\\\"block mt-1 sm:mt-1.5\\\">\\n                D\303\222NG TI\341\273\200N 30 TRI\341\273\206U- AFFILIATE-\\n              </span>\\n              <span className=\\\"block mt-1 sm:mt-1.5\\\">\\n                CH\341\273\210 C\341\272\246N (B\341\272\244M \304\220I\341\273\206N THO\341\272\240I)\\n              </span>\\n            </h1>\\n\\n            {/* Subtitle */}\\n            <p className=\\\"font-[\'Space_Grotesk\'] font-medium text-[17px] sm:text-[19px] leading-[26px] sm:leading-[28px] text-black\\\">\\n              Ch\341\273\211 7 ch\341\273\227 duy nh\341\272\245t- \304\220i\341\273\201n th\303\264ng tin c\341\273\247a b\341\272\241n xu\341\273\221ng d\306\260\341\273\233i \304\221\341\273\203 \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c gi\341\273\257 ch\341\273\227:\\n            </p>\\n\\n            {/* 3 Textboxes Form */}\\n            <form onSubmit={handleSubmit} className=\\\"w-full flex flex-col gap-3.5 sm:gap-4 mt-1\\\">\\n              {/* \303\224 1: T\303\252n c\341\273\247a b\341\272\241n */}\\n              <div>\\n                <input\\n                  type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                  required\\n                  placeholder=\\\"T\303\252n c\341\273\247a b\341\272\241n\\\"\\n                  value={formData.name}\\n                  onChange={(e) => setFormData({ ...formData, name: e.target.value })}\\n                  className=\\\"w-full h-[54px] sm:h-[58px] px-5 bg-white border border-black rounded-[14px] font-[\'Space_Grotesk\'] text-[16px] sm:text-[18px] text-black placeholder:text-[#898989] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#B9FF66]\\\"\\n                />\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* \303\224 2: S\304\220T c\341\273\247a b\341\272\241n */}\\n              <div>\\n                <input\\n                  type=\\\"tel\\\"\\n                  required\\n                  placeholder=\\\"S\304\220T c\341\273\247a b\341\272\241n\\\"\\n                  value={formData.phone}\\n                  onChange={(e) => setFormData({ ...formData, phone: e.target.value })}\\n                  className=\\\"w-full h-[54px] sm:h-[58px] px-5 bg-white border border-black rounded-[14px] font-[\'Space_Grotesk\'] text-[16px] sm:text-[18px] text-black placeholder:text-[#898989] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#B9FF66]\\\"\\n                />\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* \303\224 3: Email c\341\273\247a b\341\272\241n */}\\n              <div>\\n                <input\\n                  type=\\\"email\\\"\\n                  required\\n                  placeholder=\\\"Email c\341\273\247a b\341\272\241n\\\"\\n                  value={formData.email}\\n                  onChange={(e) => setFormData({ ...formData, email: e.target.value })}\\n                  className=\\\"w-full h-[54px] sm:h-[58px] px-5 bg-white border border-black rounded-[14px] font-[\'Space_Grotesk\'] text-[16px] sm:text-[18px] text-black placeholder:text-[#898989] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#B9FF66]\\\"\\n                />\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Success Notification */}\\n              {isSuccess && (\\n                <div className=\\\"p-3 bg-[#B9FF66] text-black text-center font-[\'Space_Grotesk\'] font-bold rounded-[14px] text-sm sm:text-base border border-black animate-fadeIn\\\">\\n                  \342\234\223 \304\220\303\243 gi\341\273\257 ch\341\273\227 th\303\240nh c\303\264ng! V\303\251 mi\341\273\205n ph\303\255 \304\221ang \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c chu\341\272\251n b\341\273\213 g\341\273\255i t\341\273\233i b\341\272\241n.\\n                </div>\\n              )}\\n\\n              {/* Button: G\341\273\254I V\303\211 MI\341\273\204N PH\303\215 CHO T\303\224I (Uppercase) */}\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"submit\\\"\\n                className=\\\"w-full h-[60px] sm:h-[66px] bg-[#191A23] text-white font-[\'Space_Grotesk\'] font-bold text-[18px] sm:text-[20px] rounded-[14px] hover:bg-[#B9FF66] hover:text-[#191A23] transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer shadow-md hover:shadow-xl uppercase tracking-wide border-2 border-[#191A23] flex items-center justify-center mt-1\\\"\\n              >\\n                G\341\273\254I V\303\211 MI\341\273\204N PH\303\215 CHO T\303\224I\\n              </button>\\n\\n              {/* D\306\260\341\273\233i n\303\272t th\303\252m ch\341\273\257 x\303\241m nh\341\273\243t gi\341\273\221ng t\303\241i b\303\272t (nh\306\260ng kh\303\264ng ghi P.s) */}\\n              <p className=\\\"font-[\'Space_Grotesk\'] text-[13px] sm:text-[14px] text-neutral-400 text-center select-none pt-0.5\\\">\\n                th\303\264ng tin c\341\273\247a b\341\272\241n \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c b\341\272\243o m\341\272\255t tuy\341\273\207t \304\221\341\273\221i\\n              </p>\\n            </form>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Right Image */}\\n          <div className=\\\"w-full lg:w-auto flex justify-center lg:justify-end shrink-0 relative\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n              {/* Subtle background glow */}\\n              <div className=\\\"absolute -inset-4 rounded-full bg-[#B9FF66]/25 blur-2xl -z-10\\\" />\\n              <img\\n                src=\\\"/assets/aistudio/1_df3c9a39.png\\\"\\n                alt=\\\"Th\341\273\255 th\303\241ch Affiliate\\\"\\n                className=\\\"w-full max-w-[360px] sm:max-w-[440px] lg:max-w-[500px] max-h-[520px] object-contain drop-shadow-2xl\\\"\\n              />\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Update Hero section with new title lines, subtitle, 3 input textboxes, uppercase button, and faint privacy text\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/Hero.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing Hero component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update Hero.tsx with 3 inputs and new copy\"}"
