    thinking: "**Reviewing Current Project State**\n\nI\'m pleased to report that both the build and lint checks are now passing without any errors. I\'ve turned my attention to the user\'s requirements and, specifically, have addressed the removal of the top and bottom border lines surrounding the running text marquee. The text now smoothly traverses the white background as intended.\n\n\n**Constructing Registration Modal**\n\nI\'ve just finished building the `RegisterModal.tsx` component. It mirrors the design in the provided image, complete with the heading, subtitle, three input fields, a submit button (\"G\341\273\254I V\303\211 MI\341\273\204N PH\303\215 CHO T\303\224I\"), and a subtle \"th\303\264ng tin c\341\273\247a b\341\272\241n \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c b\341\272\243o m\341\272\255t tuy\341\273\207t \304\221\341\273\221i\" notice. I\'ve also implemented a close button and backdrop click functionality. Additionally, I restored the Hero section title, ensuring it now reads as requested in uppercase.\n\n\n"
