  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Hero Component**\n\nOkay, I\'m currently focused on the `Hero.tsx` component, specifically the right image section. I\'m thinking critically about how the image is displayed, ensuring a large, clear portrait with appropriate cropping. The goal is visual clarity and impact. I\'m also considering the layout responsiveness, focusing on how it scales and adapts across different screen sizes, especially the placement on larger screens.\n\n\n**Refining Image Display**\n\nI\'ve been examining the image\'s display parameters more closely, specifically the cropping and scaling. My current focus is refining how the portrait is presented. The adjustments I made to `object-cover`, `object-top`, and scaling have dramatically improved the visual focus. The excess whitespace is gone, and the subject is far more impactful, especially on larger screens. The goal is to maximize the visual focus on the portrait, and to make it instantly appealing.\n\n\n"
