ct\'s hair starts ~20px from the top, and their bottom reaches the container\'s bottom border if the container height is set to `h-[460px] sm:h-[490px] lg:h-[500px]`.\n\n\n**Implementing Image Placement**\n\nI\'ve confirmed the image positioning! The subject\'s hair starts about 20px from the top, and their elbows are cropped outside the container on each side. The image is framed to meet the instructions, showing the head and losing the elbows. I\'m now ready to make the specified code edits, starting with `Hero.tsx`.\n\n\n\n"
