    thinking: "**Analyzing Layout Constraints**\n\nI\'m currently dissecting the layout constraints described, specifically the requirement to \"crop the body from the navel up and align the head with the top of the title.\" This involves examining the flexbox structure in line 11 to see how elements are arranged. I\'m focusing on how `flex-col-reverse` and `justify-between` can be manipulated to achieve this visual effect, considering the relative positioning of the elements.\n\n\n**Refining Flexbox Alignment**\n\nI\'ve discovered a modification to the flexbox setup achieves perfect vertical alignment of the head with the title. By adjusting `lg:items-start`, both the title and the image containers align at the top on larger screens. I\'ve also incorporated a `translate-y-[-5%]` to precisely position the hair\'s starting point at the container\'s top edge, making the head\'s top flush with the title. This ensures the visual alignment, as requested.\n\n\n**Calculating Crop Height**\n\nI\'ve determined the precise container height needed for the requested crop. Based on the provided image\'s proportions, the navel appears around the 60% mark relative to the hair.  To achieve the desired \"navel up\" crop with a scaled image width of 500px, I\'ve calculated a container height around 390px to 430px, with `overflow-hidden`, to ensure the body is cropped from the navel upwards, efficiently.\n\n\n**Restoring Original Descriptions**\n\nI\'m now focused on restoring the original descriptions across several components. I\'ve re-reviewed the requirements, specifically the section subtitle notation. I\'m focusing on the `description` prop in `Services.tsx`, `CaseStudies.tsx`, `WorkingProcess.tsx`, `Team.tsx`, `Testimonials.tsx`, and `ContactSection.tsx`. I need to ensure they\'re accurately populated from the initial code, and I\'m consulting the project\'s git history to recover the correct content, specifically the initial strings I had provided!\n\n\n**Re-establishing Content Integrity**\n\nI\'m now implementing the correct `description` props in the specified files. I\'ve re-established the original \"Lorem ipsum\" text across `WorkingProcess.tsx`, `Team.tsx`, and `Testimonials.tsx`. In `ContactSection.tsx`, I\'ve verified the `description` is now \"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore.\" I\'ve ensured \"Section Title\" remains as requested.\n\n\n**Numbering Subtitle Occurrences**\n\nI\'m systematically numbering every \"Subtitle\" occurrence as requested. I\'ve pinpointed all instances across various components: 12 in `Services.tsx`, 1 in `CtaBanner.tsx`, 6 in `WorkingProcess.tsx`, and 1 in `Team.tsx`. Each is being numbered sequentially for precision and clarity, ready for review.\n\n\n**Assigning Numbered Labels**\n\nI\'m now methodically labeling the subtitles across the remaining components. In `Team.tsx`, I\'ve assigned sequential numbers: Member 1 now has `name: \'Subtitle 20\'`, `role: \'Subtitle 21\'`, and the sequence continues up to Member 6, who has `name: \'Subtitle 30\'`, `role: \'Subtitle 31\'`. I\'ve also moved to `Testimonials.tsx`, where I\'ve added labels for each testemonial.\n\n\n**Implementing Thank You Page**\n\nI\'m now integrating the \"Thank You\" page with the specified content. I\'ve focused on displaying \"CH\303\232C M\341\273\252NG, B\341\272\240N \304\220\303\203 L\303\200M \304\220\306\257\341\273\242C R\341\273\222I!\" with the provided Zalo group details after form submission. I\'ll need to create a new page, which will reuse the existing template to display this congratulatory message, along with the timer set to 10 minutes and a call-to-action button linking to the Zalo group. I will also incorporate the specified title.\n\n\n**Constructing Thank You Page**\n\nI\'m now building the \"Thank You\" page component, `src/components/ThankYouPage.tsx`, incorporating all details. I\'m focusing on the component\'s structure: a breadcrumb/back button to the homepage; a styled container using signature Positivus/NAMIND design with the requested badge; and the congratulatory title in uppercase and bold. I will also be adding the required content.\n\n\n**Designing Thank You Content**\n\nI\'m now populating the Thank You page with all specified elements and content. I\'ve integrated the congratulatory message and Zalo group details. I am also working on the timer with crisp red text, ensuring real-time countdown functionality from 10 minutes. I\'m focusing on the button styling and text, which is designed to direct users to the Zalo group. I am working on its layout to be consistent with the design.\n\n\n**Integrating QR Code Design**\n\nI\'m now integrating the QR code section within the Thank You page design. I\'ve focused on ensuring the card containing the QR code is clearly displayed with the exact dimensions specified. The design includes a bold, glowing green border with pulse/hover effects. The provided text, \"Qu\303\251t m\303\243 QR-code \360\237\221\206 \304\221\341\273\203 \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c v\303\240o nh\303\263m lu\303\264n nh\303\251,\" sits underneath the QR image. I\'ve also incorporated the correct image.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1332824"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useState, useEffect } from \'react\';\\n\\ninterface ThankYouPageProps {\\n  onBackToHome: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const ThankYouPage: React.FC<ThankYouPageProps> = ({ onBackToHome }) => {\\n  // 10 minutes countdown in seconds (600 seconds)\\n  const [timeLeft, setTimeLeft] = useState<number>(10 * 60);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (timeLeft <= 0) return;\\n    const interval = setInterval(() => {\\n      setTimeLeft((prev) => (prev > 0 ? prev - 1 : 0));\\n    }, 1000);\\n    return () => clearInterval(interval);\\n  }, [timeLeft]);\\n\\n  const hours = Math.floor(timeLeft / 3600);\\n  const minutes = Math.floor((timeLeft % 3600) / 60);\\n  const seconds = timeLeft % 60;\\n\\n  const zaloGroupLink = \'https://zalo.me/g/a2y2x036pqkwzig7u9ri\';\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"w-full py-10 sm:py-16 bg-[#FAFAFA] min-h-[80vh] flex flex-col justify-center\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-[900px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\\\">\\n        {/* Navigation Breadcrumb / Back button */}\\n        <div className=\\\"mb-6\\\">\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onBackToHome}\\n            className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-[\'Space_Grotesk\'] text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold text-neutral-600 hover:text-black transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n          >\\n            \342\206\220 Quay l\341\272\241i trang ch\341\273\247\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Main Thank You Card */}\\n        <div className=\\\"bg-white border-2 border-[#191A23] rounded-[36px] sm:rounded-[45px] p-6 sm:p-12 lg:p-14 positivus-shadow flex flex-col items-center text-center\\\">\\n          {/* Badge */}\\n          <div className=\\\"inline-block px-4 py-1.5 bg-[#B9FF66] rounded-[10px] border border-[#191A23] mb-6\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"font-[\'Space_Grotesk\'] font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm text-black tracking-wider uppercase\\\">\\n              B\306\260\341\273\233c Cu\341\273\221i C\303\271ng \304\220\341\273\203 Ho\303\240n T\341\272\245t\\n            </span>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* [TITLE] */}\\n          <h1 className=\\\"font-[\'Space_Grotesk\'] font-extrabold text-[30px] sm:text-[44px] lg:text-[50px] leading-[36px] sm:leading-[50px] lg:leading-[56px] text-black tracking-tight uppercase max-w-[760px]\\\">\\n            CH\303\232C M\341\273\252NG,\\n            <span className=\\\"block text-[#191A23] mt-1 sm:mt-2\\\">B\341\272\240N \304\220\303\203 L\303\200M \304\220\306\257\341\273\242C R\341\273\222I!</span>\\n          </h1>\\n\\n          {/* Paragraph explanation */}\\n          <p className=\\\"mt-6 font-[\'Space_Grotesk\'] font-medium text-[17px] sm:text-[20px] leading-[26px] sm:leading-[30px] text-neutral-800 max-w-[700px]\\\">\\n            B\306\260\341\273\233c cu\341\273\221i c\303\271ng, Ch\341\273\211 trong nh\303\263m k\303\255n Zalo ch\303\272ng t\303\264i m\341\273\233i cung c\341\272\245p l\341\273\213ch h\341\273\215c, chi\341\272\277n l\306\260\341\273\243c, b\303\240i t\341\272\255p, t\303\240i li\341\273\207u v\303\240 \360\237\216\201qu\303\240 t\341\272\267ng l\303\252n \304\221\341\272\277n 125.970.000 \304\221....\\n          </p>\\n\\n          {/* Warning badge */}\\n          <div className=\\\"mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2.5 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-300 rounded-[14px] text-amber-900 font-[\'Space_Grotesk\'] font-bold text-[14px] sm:text-[16px]\\\">\\n            <span>\342\232\240\357\270\217 (M\341\273\231t nh\303\263m duy nh\341\272\245t, m\341\273\231t n\306\241i duy nh\341\272\245t, ch\303\272ng t\303\264i ch\341\273\211 duy\341\273\207t trong 3 ph\303\272t)</span>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* [TIMER] - 10 minutes styled as image_0ad707c8.png */}\\n          <div className=\\\"my-8 sm:my-10 flex items-center justify-center gap-8 sm:gap-14 select-none\\\">\\n            {/* Hours */}\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col items-center\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"font-[\'Space_Grotesk\'] font-light text-[46px] sm:text-[64px] leading-none text-[#E11D48]\\\">\\n                {hours}\\n              </span>\\n              <span className=\\\"font-[\'Space_Grotesk\'] text-[15px] sm:text-[18px] text-neutral-600 mt-2 font-normal\\\">\\n                hours\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Separator */}\\n            <span className=\\\"text-[#E11D48] text-3xl font-light -mt-6\\\">:</span>\\n\\n            {/* Minutes */}\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col items-center\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"font-[\'Space_Grotesk\'] font-light text-[46px] sm:text-[64px] leading-none text-[#E11D48]\\\">\\n                {String(minutes).padStart(2, \'0\')}\\n              </span>\\n              <span className=\\\"font-[\'Space_Grotesk\'] text-[15px] sm:text-[18px] text-neutral-600 mt-2 font-normal\\\">\\n                minutes\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Separator */}\\n            <span className=\\\"text-[#E11D48] text-3xl font-light -mt-6\\\">:</span>\\n\\n            {/* Seconds */}\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col items-center\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"font-[\'Space_Grotesk\'] font-light text-[46px] sm:text-[64px] leading-none text-[#E11D48]\\\">\\n                {String(seconds).padStart(2, \'0\')}\\n              </span>\\n              <span className=\\\"font-[\'Space_Grotesk\'] text-[15px] sm:text-[18px] text-neutral-600 mt-2 font-normal\\\">\\n                seconds\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* [N\303\232T NH\341\272\244N] - B\341\272\244M \304\220\341\273\202 V\303\200O NH\303\223M ZALO K\303\215N */}\\n          <div className=\\\"w-full max-w-[540px] flex flex-col items-center gap-2\\\">\\n            <a\\n              href={zaloGroupLink}\\n              target=\\\"_blank\\\"\\n              rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\\n              className=\\\"w-full py-5 px-6 sm:px-8 bg-[#191A23] text-white hover:bg-[#B9FF66] hover:text-[#191A23] rounded-[18px] border-2 border-[#191A23] shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-200 transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center cursor-pointer group\\\"\\n            >\\n              <span className=\\\"font-[\'Space_Grotesk\'] font-extrabold text-[18px] sm:text-[22px] tracking-wide uppercase\\\">\\n                B\341\272\244M \304\220\341\273\202 V\303\200O NH\303\223M ZALO K\303\215N\\n              </span>\\n              <span className=\\\"font-[\'Space_Grotesk\'] font-medium text-[13px] sm:text-[14px] text-neutral-300 group-hover:text-black mt-1\\\">\\n                (Kh\303\264ng v\303\240o nh\303\263m kh\303\264ng \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c h\341\273\215c nhanh tay b\341\272\245m v\303\240o nh\303\263m ngay nh\303\251)\\n              </span>\\n            </a>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* QR Code Section */}\\n          <div className=\\\"mt-10 pt-8 border-t border-neutral-200 w-full flex flex-col items-center\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"p-3 bg-white border-2 border-[#191A23] rounded-[24px] shadow-md inline-block\\\">\\n              <img\\n                src=\\\"/assets/aistudio/image_0b59f36d.png\\\"\\n                alt=\\\"QR Code Nh\303\263m Zalo K\303\255n\\\"\\n                className=\\\"w-[180px] h-[180px] sm:w-[200px] sm:h-[200px] object-contain rounded-[14px]\\\"\\n              />\\n            </div>\\n            <p className=\\\"mt-4 font-[\'Space_Grotesk\'] font-semibold text-[15px] sm:text-[17px] text-black\\\">\\n              (Qu\303\251t m\303\243 QR-code \360\237\221\206 \304\221\341\273\203 \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c v\303\240o nh\303\263m lu\303\264n nh\303\251)\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create ThankYouPage component with 10-minute timer, Zalo group link, and QR code\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/ThankYouPage.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating ThankYouPage component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create ThankYouPage.tsx\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\310o\n\305o\001i\024}\023\337!.\n\277`P\2647\245N\377\356\212gr\352+\335T \201\253\256\031\300\2267\377kx<\324f\035)\030\263\355\241\272\221n\210r\346I\373\344\037 \255\022\217\211\334X2\337o,\230\235\036\027\245\325\304\032y`\035d\327\n;\026\323\304\346P\b\226\203\361\333\322\304\247tm\253\352\200#\265\3400I1\336G32>\b\273\t4b3R\233\277\250\252p\364:\220s\227}4d\017\211\247<\3307\227e \355-&xF\231(\204Y\333E\337Q\250\326\263\001IH\0224\222\v1\202\317\301\363i\300\235a\311Y\230\244\347;\034t\322_9\375\347\342$+\354\332\\ Rp\267*r\t\354\036K=\330?\213Q\245\377skh\212\305\266\366\200\302=\270\354m\351\343\322\325}\301Ig\351\332TBm\272+\360\271\262\326\354\272\263^\250\030\243S\230PF\345NI\242\337\273\226\342\236\bS\273!\302\341\343\243\327\233\214\302\315\035\335\000\333\241\341\244\324\235\006\351c\324&F\367=\237\004\261\345\v\032\216D\r\250\203>8E\036\3473\177O\354/y\340\302\207%\250\304\234+\321{!\275\344_!5\202!\211d\216\271$`\341IM[Iir\231U_Lw\236\375T\346\236P\271v\252n3\250\332\225v\320\204)\376lB\204O\3056O\257\216u\245\'\255\266\234le\224\035\027e]\201b\2474(\006\204\314\201W\026\303\333Y\267\355\353\245E\251W\355a\245=q\232\201c\322\340\357\2370lBPWMc\3755\312=\277Q\356\302\001Bj)\340n,8\247\0236\034\342\017\034\033\376\031\327&\024P\034\017K\3014\331\002\305\263\373\261%\b\023\252\3653\254Z\246\332\230\270\027\333\366v?\376\033R\340\212\034\275{c\274\363:\361\305\215\231I\377,\243q\341\034b\332\025F\022\342\362\275%\341#r\241 K\375\251\240\211\bUs4\3258N\227a\331\353\352\377f\250\372W\245\216 *\336c\365\323yxf\254\255/\266\353\260\254\356\320\032Qd\301h\267\373\346N\337\315\0275k\357\307\230n/U\f\372\345$T%\211\252\352uy\256\333\272\225\2634:\362\005\355\213\r\240\023\232\351\203\\2\237f\206p\351q\a\362\305R8\324\263zEr\266\240\335\004GB%\006\334\001nj\302\204\255\353\232K+\032%\305\257b0\303E\230\231\2406\016\002\360\004\345:\304y\242&\325V\276%\371\240\232~\255\273\254\210\277t\ta\274\036\325\002\033\222\261-\243$\305\207\'