  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Adding Thank You Page**\n\nI\'m incorporating the `ThankYouPage` component into `App.tsx` and updating the state management. I\'ve introduced a `currentPage` state variable to manage navigation between the \'home\' and \'thank-you\' views. The plan is to update this state from the `RegisterModal`\'s submission handler to smoothly transition the user.\n\n\n**Refining Navigation Logic**\n\nI\'ve just solidified the navigation flow. Now, the `ThankYouPage` component properly handles the \"back to home\" action with a smooth scroll. The `Navbar` component also links the logo back to the home page if the user\'s on the Thank You page. I\'ve updated the `onLogoClick` handler accordingly. The component switching and scrolling are behaving seamlessly now!\n\n\n"
