  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 1
    session_summary: "<summary>\n### 1. Task Overview\n- **User\'s latest request:**\n  1. Move Section Title 2 (which is `<CaseStudies />`, the black container / \"\303\264 \304\221en\" with 3 columns previously under Services) to be **above** Section Title 1 (`<Services />`).\n  2. Rename the section title badge to:\n     `TH\341\273\254 TH\303\201CH 2 NG\303\200Y AFFILIATE T\341\273\260 \304\220\341\273\230NG D\303\222NG TI\341\273\200N 100 TRI\341\273\206U \342\200\223 D\303\200NH CHO B\341\272\240N, N\341\272\276U...`\n  3. Update the content inside the black box (\303\264 \304\221en). Instead of the 3 columns of lorem ipsum, put the 4 user-specified bullet points with tick marks (`\342\234\223` / green checkmarks):\n     - Bullet 1: `B\341\272\241n nh\303\254n AI c\303\240n qu\303\251t, th\341\272\245y r\303\265 c\303\264ng vi\341\273\207c l\303\240m thu\303\252 kh\303\264ng th\341\273\203 \304\221\306\260a b\341\272\241n l\303\252n 100 tri\341\273\207u/th\303\241ng`\n     - Bullet 2: `B\341\272\241n \304\221\303\243 th\341\273\255 b\303\241n h\303\240ng online, \304\221\341\273\225 ti\341\273\201n qu\341\272\243ng c\303\241o\342\200\246 nh\306\260ng kh\303\241ch kh\303\264ng \304\221\341\272\277n, ti\341\273\201n kh\303\264ng v\341\273\201.`\n     - Bullet 3: `B\341\272\241n m\341\273\207t m\341\273\217i v\341\273\233i m\303\264 h\303\254nh c\303\264ng vi\341\273\207c c\305\251: c\303\240ng l\303\240m c\303\240ng k\341\272\271t, thu nh\341\272\255p kh\303\264ng bao gi\341\273\235 v\306\260\341\273\243t ng\306\260\341\273\241ng.`\n     - Bullet 4: `B\341\272\241n mu\341\273\221n m\341\273\231t l\341\273\221i \304\221i kh\303\241c - th\341\273\261c t\341\272\277, d\341\273\205 l\303\240m - n\306\241i ch\341\273\211 c\341\272\247n bi\341\272\277t b\341\272\245m \304\221i\341\273\207n tho\341\272\241i, b\341\272\241n c\303\263 ngay h\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng ra kh\303\241ch, ra ti\341\273\201n m\341\272\267t....`\n     - Explicit instruction: \"Nh\341\273\233 l\303\240 n\341\273\231i dung \304\221en nh\341\273\233 \304\221\341\273\203 d\341\272\245u tick nha\" and \"C\303\263 d\341\272\245u tick \341\273\237 \304\221\341\272\247u\".\n\n### 2. Progress\n- **Completed in earlier turns:**\n  - Hero image updated to `/assets/aistudio/2_88a1ec16.png`, framed from navel (\"ph\341\272\247n r\341\273\221n\") up and top of head aligned with top of title (`src/components/Hero.tsx`).\n  - Title & subtitle centered in `RegisterModal.tsx`.\n  - Created `ThankYouPage.tsx` with a 10-minute real-time countdown timer (matching `image_0ad707c8.png`), link to Zalo group `https://zalo.me/g/a2y2x036pqkwzig7u9ri`, and QR code `/assets/aistudio/image_0b59f36d.png`.\n  - Wired `App.tsx` page transition: submitting the register modal moves to the Thank You page.\n  - Subtitle numbering resolved: every literal placeholder \"Subtitle\" numbered sequentially across cards (Subtitle 1\342\200\22341), while SectionHeading descriptions retained their original text.\n- **In progress / Just requested:**\n  - Rearranging `<CaseStudies />` above `<Services />` in `src/App.tsx`.\n  - Updating `src/components/CaseStudies.tsx` with the new title and the 4 tick-marked items.\n\n### 3. Key Findings & Decisions\n- `src/components/CaseStudies.tsx` currently renders 3 columns (`grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 lg:divide-x lg:divide-white/30`) with `cases` array and `Learn More \342\206\227` buttons.\n- The new content has 4 items with checkmarks (\"d\341\272\245u tick \341\273\237 \304\221\341\272\247u\").\n- A 2x2 grid or a 4-column layout or list layout inside the black container (`bg-[#191A23] rounded-[45px] p-8 sm:p-14 lg:p-16`) with green checkmark icons (`#B9FF66`) in front of each paragraph fits the Positivus design system seamlessly.\n- Section ordering in `src/App.tsx`:\n  - Current: `<Hero />` -> `<Logotypes />` -> `<Services />` -> `<CtaBanner />` -> `<CaseStudies />` -> `<WorkingProcess />` -> ...\n  - New order: `<Hero />` -> `<Logotypes />` -> `<CaseStudies />` -> `<Services />` -> `<CtaBanner />` -> `<WorkingProcess />` -> ...\n\n### 4. Active Context\n- Files to modify:\n  - `src/App.tsx`: Swap the order so `<CaseStudies />` is rendered immediately after `<Logotypes />` (and before `<Services />`).\n  - `src/components/CaseStudies.tsx`:\n    - SectionHeading `title=\"TH\341\273\254 TH\303\201CH 2 NG\303\200Y AFFILIATE T\341\273\260 \304\220\341\273\230NG D\303\222NG TI\341\273\200N 100 TRI\341\273\206U \342\200\223 D\303\200NH CHO B\341\272\240N, N\341\272\276U...\"`\n    - Update the items inside the dark box to 4 items with checkmarks.\n- Design tokens:\n  - Positivus Green: `#B9FF66` (great for tick icon badge / checkmark).\n  - Dark box: `#191A23` with `rounded-[45px]`.\n\n### 5. Next Steps\n1. Edit `src/components/CaseStudies.tsx`:\n   - Change SectionHeading title to:\n     `\"TH\341\273\254 TH\303\201CH 2 NG\303\200Y AFFILIATE T\341\273\260 \304\220\341\273\230NG D\303\222NG TI\341\273\200N 100 TRI\341\273\206U \342\200\223 D\303\200NH CHO B\341\272\240N, N\341\272\276U...\"`\n   - Description can be cleared or set to empty string if not needed (or kept concise).\n   - Change the dark container inner items to the 4 checkmarked points in a clean, legible 2-column or 4-item grid (e.g. `grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 sm:gap-8`), with a distinct green tick mark badge (`bg-[#B9FF66] text-[#191A23] rounded-full p-1` or SVG checkmark) at the start of each point.\n2. Edit `src/App.tsx`:\n   - Move `<CaseStudies />` to be directly above `<Services />`.\n3. Verify:\n   - Run `compile_applet` and `lint_applet`.\n   - Verify dev server on port 3000.\n4. Provide a clear, concise summary to the user in Vietnamese.\n\n### 6. Commitments & Constraints\n- Must have checkmark (`d\341\272\245u tick`) at the beginning of each of the 4 items inside the black box.\n- Maintain Space Grotesk typography and Positivus design tokens (`#B9FF66`, `#191A23`).\n- Do not introduce AI chatbots or extra unrequested dependencies.\n</summary>"
