    user_requests: "Postivus thay b\341\272\261ng Namind (b\341\273\217 logo phi ti\303\252u \304\221i) \nNguy\303\252n line sponsor th\303\240nh m\341\273\231t d\303\262ng ch\341\273\257 ch\341\272\241y ngang gi\341\273\221ng b\341\272\243ng led \"Th\341\273\255 th\303\241ch tr\306\260c ti\341\272\277p! 2 ng\303\240y Affiliate 100 tri\341\273\207u/ th\303\241ng ch\341\273\211 b\341\272\261ng chi\341\272\277c \304\221i\341\273\207n tho\341\272\241i\",\n\nCh\341\273\211nh title\nTH\341\273\254 TH\303\201CH 2 NG\303\200Y - D\303\222NG TI\341\273\200N 100 TRI\341\273\206U/ TH\303\201NG T\341\273\252 AFFILIATE \n[Xu\341\273\221ng d\303\262ng]\nch\341\273\211 c\341\272\247n Bi\341\272\277t B\341\272\245m \304\220i\341\273\207n Tho\341\272\241i (MI\341\273\204N PH\303\215)\n\nCh\341\273\211nh c\303\241i bottom bar th\303\240nh topbar tr\303\252n topbar\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nMedia attachment: User sent attachment: /assets/aistudio/image_3026b839.png (saved in workspace at /public/assets/aistudio/image_3026b839.png). Read it with view_file at that path; in shell commands, which run from the workspace root, use the relative path public/assets/aistudio/image_3026b839.png. When displaying or embedding this asset in code, reference this local file path directly. Only invoke image generation tools if the user explicitly requests creating or modifying an image.\n  User sent attachment: /assets/aistudio/image_94c4476d.png (saved in workspace at /public/assets/aistudio/image_94c4476d.png). Read it with view_file at that path; in shell commands, which run from the workspace root, use the relative path public/assets/aistudio/image_94c4476d.png. When displaying or embedding this asset in code, reference this local file path directly. Only invoke image generation tools if the user explicitly requests creating or modifying an image.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
