    thinking: "**Verifying User Requirements**\n\nI\'ve confirmed a successful linting and build with zero errors. Currently, I\'m meticulously checking the user\'s specified requirement: \"\304\220\341\273\225i section title 2 l\303\252n tr\303\252n section title 1\". The `<CaseStudies />` component has been positioned directly after `<Logotypes />` and before `<Services />` as part of this process.\n\n\n**Updating Section Title**\n\nI\'ve just updated the `SectionHeading` title to precisely match the uppercase string: `TH\341\273\254 TH\303\201CH 2 NG\303\200Y AFFILIATE T\341\273\260 \304\220\341\273\230NG D\303\222NG TI\341\273\200N 100 TRI\341\273\206U \342\200\223 D\303\200NH CHO B\341\272\240N, N\341\272\276U...`. I\'m also ensuring the associated content in the black box incorporates the requested bullet points, complete with the specified checkmark icons at the beginning of each item.\n\n\n"
