  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Case Studies**\n\nI\'m currently looking into the `CaseStudies.tsx` file. I\'ve noted a title with Vietnamese text, specifically the phrase \"TH\341\273\254 TH\303\201CH 2 NG\303\200Y...\" and its associated bold font styling. I\'m now examining the bottom bar elements, focusing on styling.\n\n\n**Highlighting Specific Text**\n\nI\'ve decided to emphasize the \"7 spots only\" message. I\'m going with a glowing green highlight for that part, coupled with a larger, bold font and a slight adjustment to the leading. I\'m now implementing the code to achieve this.\n\n\n**Refining the UI Elements**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the visual styling of specific UI elements. I really like the clean, high-contrast look and feel on the dark background. The green glow around \"Ch\341\273\211 7 ch\341\273\227 duy nh\341\272\245t trong \304\221\341\273\243t n\303\240y\" is working great. I\'ve also incorporated an uppercase button with an arrow, which looks slick and modern. I\'m satisfied with the current design choices.\n\n\n**Considering Button Aesthetics**\n\nI\'m now contemplating button aesthetics, specifically the right-arrow icon. I\'m considering using the `\360\237\221\211` emoji, as it\'s universally understood in Vietnamese CTAs, or a more traditional SVG arrow, like the one I\'ve pasted. Ultimately, I\'m leaning toward offering both options, with `\360\237\221\211` likely taking precedence. Let\'s see how the user will respond.\n\n\n**Evaluating Arrow Icons**\n\nI\'m now comparing different arrow icons for the button. I\'m exploring the use of a simple `\360\237\221\211` emoji versus an SVG arrow. I also considered alternatives like `\342\236\224` and `\342\206\222`. I\'m going to look at adding an arrow icon at the front of the text as well, with the SVG arrow as an alternative.\n\n\n**Implementing Button Elements**\n\nI\'ve decided to move forward with the implementation. I\'m going with the finger emoji `\360\237\221\211` and an SVG arrow, positioned before the call-to-action text: \"NH\341\272\244N V\303\200O \304\220\303\202Y \304\220\341\273\202 GI\341\273\256 CH\341\273\226 NGAY B\303\202Y GI\341\273\234\". I\'m using the provided code snippet to create an attractive, interactive button. I\'ve designed the button using the given `className` properties, including hover effects.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1463726"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport { SectionHeading } from \'./SectionHeading\';\\n\\ninterface CaseStudiesProps {\\n  onCtaClick?: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const CaseStudies: React.FC<CaseStudiesProps> = ({ onCtaClick }) => {\\n  const painPoints = [\\n    {\\n      id: 1,\\n      text: \'B\341\272\241n nh\303\254n AI c\303\240n qu\303\251t, th\341\272\245y r\303\265 c\303\264ng vi\341\273\207c l\303\240m thu\303\252 kh\303\264ng th\341\273\203 \304\221\306\260a b\341\272\241n l\303\252n 100 tri\341\273\207u/th\303\241ng\',\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: 2,\\n      text: \'B\341\272\241n \304\221\303\243 th\341\273\255 b\303\241n h\303\240ng online, \304\221\341\273\225 ti\341\273\201n qu\341\272\243ng c\303\241o\342\200\246 nh\306\260ng kh\303\241ch kh\303\264ng \304\221\341\272\277n, ti\341\273\201n kh\303\264ng v\341\273\201.\',\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: 3,\\n      text: \'B\341\272\241n m\341\273\207t m\341\273\217i v\341\273\233i m\303\264 h\303\254nh c\303\264ng vi\341\273\207c c\305\251: c\303\240ng l\303\240m c\303\240ng k\341\272\271t, thu nh\341\272\255p kh\303\264ng bao gi\341\273\235 v\306\260\341\273\243t ng\306\260\341\273\241ng.\',\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: 4,\\n      text: \'B\341\272\241n mu\341\273\221n m\341\273\231t l\341\273\221i \304\221i kh\303\241c - th\341\273\261c t\341\272\277, d\341\273\205 l\303\240m - n\306\241i ch\341\273\211 c\341\272\247n bi\341\272\277t b\341\272\245m \304\221i\341\273\207n tho\341\272\241i, b\341\272\241n c\303\263 ngay h\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng ra kh\303\241ch, ra ti\341\273\201n m\341\272\267t....\',\\n    },\\n  ];\\n\\n  return (\\n    <section id=\\\"cases\\\" className=\\\"w-full py-12 sm:py-16\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\\\">\\n        <SectionHeading\\n          title=\\\"TH\341\273\254 TH\303\201CH 2 NG\303\200Y AFFILIATE T\341\273\260 \304\220\341\273\230NG D\303\222NG TI\341\273\200N 100 TRI\341\273\206U \342\200\223 D\303\200NH CHO B\341\272\240N, N\341\272\276U...\\\"\\n          titleClassName=\\\"font-bold\\\"\\n          description=\\\"\\\"\\n        />\\n\\n        {/* Khung \303\264 \304\221en v\341\273\233i 4 n\341\273\231i dung c\303\263 d\341\272\245u tick xanh n\341\273\225i b\341\272\255t \341\273\237 \304\221\341\272\247u */}\\n        <div className=\\\"bg-[#191A23] rounded-[45px] p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-14 positivus-shadow\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 sm:gap-8\\\">\\n            {painPoints.map((item) => (\\n              <div\\n                key={item.id}\\n                className=\\\"bg-[#23242E] border border-white/10 hover:border-[#B9FF66]/60 transition-all rounded-[24px] p-6 sm:p-7 flex items-start gap-4\\\"\\n              >\\n                {/* D\341\272\245u tick n\341\273\225i b\341\272\255t \341\273\237 \304\221\341\272\247u */}\\n                <div className=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#B9FF66] text-[#191A23] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 shadow-sm\\\">\\n                  <svg\\n                    className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-[#191A23]\\\"\\n                    viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"\\n                    fill=\\\"none\\\"\\n                    stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\"\\n                    strokeWidth=\\\"3.2\\\"\\n                    strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\"\\n                    strokeLinejoin=\\\"round\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    <polyline points=\\\"20 6 9 17 4 12\\\" />\\n                  </svg>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* N\341\273\231i dung \304\221o\341\272\241n v\304\203n */}\\n                <p className=\\\"font-[\'Space_Grotesk\'] font-normal text-[16px] sm:text-[18px] lg:text-[19px] leading-[26px] sm:leading-[28px] text-white\\\">\\n                  {item.text}\\n                </p>\\n              </div>\\n            ))}\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {onCtaClick && (\\n            <div className=\\\"mt-8 sm:mt-10 pt-6 sm:pt-8 border-t border-white/15 flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-5\\\">\\n              {/* Highlight & Bold v\341\273\233i c\341\273\241 ch\341\273\257 l\341\273\233n h\306\241n */}\\n              <div className=\\\"text-center lg:text-left\\\">\\n                <p className=\\\"font-[\'Space_Grotesk\'] font-bold text-[17px] sm:text-[19px] lg:text-[21px] leading-[28px] sm:leading-[32px] text-white\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-[#191A23] bg-[#B9FF66] px-3 py-1 rounded-[10px] inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 mr-2 font-black shadow-sm\\\">\\n                    <span>\342\232\241</span>\\n                    <span>Ch\341\273\211 7 ch\341\273\227 duy nh\341\272\245t trong \304\221\341\273\243t n\303\240y</span>\\n                  </span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-[#B9FF66] font-bold\\\">\342\200\224 \304\220i\341\273\201n th\303\264ng tin \304\221\341\273\203 \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c gi\341\273\257 ch\341\273\227:</span>\\n                </p>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* N\303\272t uppercase v\303\240 c\303\263 m\305\251i t\303\252n \304\221\341\272\261ng tr\306\260\341\273\233c */}\\n              <button\\n                onClick={onCtaClick}\\n                className=\\\"shrink-0 group flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 bg-[#B9FF66] text-[#191A23] px-6 sm:px-8 py-3.5 sm:py-4 rounded-[14px] font-[\'Space_Grotesk\'] font-bold text-[15px] sm:text-[16px] uppercase hover:bg-white transition-all cursor-pointer border-2 border-[#B9FF66] whitespace-nowrap shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:translate-y-0\\\"\\n              >\\n                <span className=\\\"text-lg sm:text-xl leading-none group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\\\">\\n                  \360\237\221\211\\n                </span>\\n                <span>NH\341\272\244N V\303\200O \304\220\303\202Y \304\220\341\273\202 GI\341\273\256 CH\341\273\226 NGAY B\303\202Y GI\341\273\234</span>\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n          )}\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Make title bold, highlight and enlarge the 7-spot text, and make CTA button uppercase with arrow in front\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/CaseStudies.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating CaseStudies.tsx\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update CaseStudies with bold title, highlighted text, and arrow button\"}"
