e gaps and alignment too.\n\n\n**Implementing the Components**\n\nI\'m now implementing the components, focusing on the text elements and the green button, meticulously incorporating all the specific styling details: font sizes, colors, the italicized quote, and hover effects. I am also making sure that the button behavior on click triggers the registration popup modal, as required. My priority is ensuring pixel-perfect reproduction.\n\n\n**Incorporating the Image**\n\nI am now focusing on the right column and integrating the placeholder for the image. I am confirming the need for a dashed border and rounded corners to maintain the visual structure. My focus is now the placement of the image within the container.\n\n\n"
