  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 2
    session_summary: "<summary>\n1. **Task Overview**\n   - User request: \"Crop l\341\272\241i ch\341\273\211nh l\341\272\241i h\303\254nh \341\272\243nh ch\303\242n dung t\341\273\253 r\341\273\221n tr\341\273\237 l\303\252n nha\" (Re-crop and adjust the portrait photo of Nam Anh so that it shows from the navel/waist up).\n   - Attachment: The user re-uploaded `2.png` (a transparent cut-out PNG of Nam Anh wearing glasses, hoodie, and blazer with hands folded at waist level).\n   - Context: The portrait image is primarily displayed in the Hero section (`src/components/Hero.tsx`), plus avatar thumbnails in `Testimonials.tsx`. The user specifically wants the main portrait in the Hero section to be framed properly: cropped from the navel up (\"t\341\273\253 r\341\273\221n tr\341\273\237 l\303\252n\"), without showing below the navel or cutting off awkwardly, top-aligned with the hero heading.\n\n2. **Progress**\n   - Completed previously:\n     - Section Title 2 (`CaseStudies.tsx`) moved above Section Title 1.\n     - \303\224 Subtitle 13 (`CtaBanner.tsx`) restructured to match the Figma template (left-aligned text, black button, reserved blank image placeholder on right) and moved above Section Title 1.\n     - Section Title 5 (`Testimonials.tsx`) customized with Nam Anh\'s letter, author bar moved to the top, light green background boxes removed while keeping bold green `#B9FF66` text highlights, and moved above Section Title 1.\n     - Created new white section `AffiliateModelSection.tsx` with clean typography extracted from user screenshot (`image_0d2f81eb.png`) and blank image slot on the right.\n     - Global brand `NAMIND` updated to uppercase in Navbar, Footer, and metadata.\n   - In progress:\n     - Need to check where the uploaded `2.png` is stored or if `public/assets/aistudio/2_88a1ec16.png` or `public/assets/aistudio/2_585170d0.png` corresponds to it, and adjust `src/components/Hero.tsx` styling (container height, image scale, `object-position`, `transform`, `overflow-hidden`) so the image is framed cleanly from the navel up.\n\n3. **Key Findings**\n   - `src/components/Hero.tsx` lines 43-58 currently contain:\n     ```tsx\n     <div className=\"relative w-full h-[380px] sm:h-[415px] lg:h-[440px] flex items-start justify-center overflow-hidden\">\n       <img\n         src=\"/assets/aistudio/2_88a1ec16.png\"\n         alt=\"Ch\303\242n dung \304\221\341\272\241i di\341\273\207n Th\341\273\255 th\303\241ch Affiliate\"\n         className=\"w-full h-auto aspect-square object-contain object-top scale-[1.36] sm:scale-[1.38] lg:scale-[1.4] origin-top translate-y-[-5%] drop-shadow-[0_20px_35px_rgba(0,0,0,0.18)] select-none pointer-events-none\"\n       />\n     </div>\n     ```\n   - In the newly uploaded image `2.png`, the subject\'s hands are clasped near the navel, and the coat ends around the waist/hips. If the image container height or scale cuts off improperly, or if the bottom of the cut shows below the navel, the container must mask it right at the navel level (approx. right below the clasped hands and buttons).\n   - Check if `public/assets/aistudio/2_585170d0.png` or `public/assets/aistudio/2_88a1ec16.png` is the target, or if the user\'s latest upload is located at `2.png` in the root or public folder.\n\n4. **Active Context**\n   - Dev server runs on port 3000.\n   - Vite + React + Tailwind CSS setup.\n\n5. **Next Steps**\n   1. Check the path of the newly uploaded `2.png` (check `ls public/assets/aistudio/` or root `2.png`).\n   2. In `src/components/Hero.tsx`, adjust the image wrapper and `<img>` styling:\n      - Set an appropriate fixed/responsive height with `overflow-hidden` so that the bottom edge cuts off cleanly right at the navel (just under the hands/lower button).\n      - Ensure the head is not cut off at the top (top-aligned with the title text).\n      - Adjust `scale` and `object-top` or `translate-y` so the framing looks natural, professional, and bold.\n   3. Verify with `compile_applet` and `lint_applet`.\n\n6. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - Ensure the image is cropped strictly from the navel up (\"t\341\273\253 r\341\273\221n tr\341\273\237 l\303\252n\").\n   - Maintain Positivus design system aesthetic and fast responsive layout.\n</summary>"
    included_step_index_start: 182
    included_step_index_end: 330
    user_requests: "\342\200\224 \304\220i\341\273\201n th\303\264ng tin \304\221\341\273\203 \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c gi\341\273\257 ch\341\273\227: B\341\273\217 c\303\241i n\303\240y cho m\303\254nh"
