    user_requests: "\303\224 Subtitle 13 \304\221\341\273\203 l\303\252n tr\303\252n section title 1 \nV\341\273\233i n\341\273\231i dung nh\306\260 h\303\254nh \341\272\243nh m\303\254nh g\341\273\255i, ch\341\273\227 logo \304\221\341\273\203 tr\341\273\221ng \304\221\303\263 (m\303\254nh s\341\272\275 thay b\341\272\261ng h\303\254nh \341\272\243nh sau, hi\341\273\207n t\341\272\241i c\341\273\251 \304\221\341\273\203 tr\341\273\221ng)\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nMedia attachment: User sent attachment: /assets/aistudio/image_9f37dc01.png (saved in workspace at /public/assets/aistudio/image_9f37dc01.png). Read it with view_file at that path; in shell commands, which run from the workspace root, use the relative path public/assets/aistudio/image_9f37dc01.png. When displaying or embedding this asset in code, reference this local file path directly. Only invoke image generation tools if the user explicitly requests creating or modifying an image.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
