  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Image with Sharp**\n\nI\'ve got Sharp up and running super fast! The next step involves a Node script utilizing this library. My plan is to analyze a couple of PNGs, trim the alpha borders, and dive into the bounding boxes. Then, I\'ll perform a precise crop from the navel upwards.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_420490"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"node -e \'\\nconst sharp = require(\\\"sharp\\\");\\n\\nasync function check() {\\n  const meta1 = await sharp(\\\"public/assets/aistudio/2_88a1ec16.png\\\").metadata();\\n  console.log(\\\"2_88a1ec16 meta:\\\", meta1.width, meta1.height, meta1.channels);\\n  \\n  // Trim transparent pixels and get bounding box\\n  const trimmed = await sharp(\\\"public/assets/aistudio/2_88a1ec16.png\\\").trim().toBuffer({ resolveWithObject: true });\\n  console.log(\\\"Trimmed dimensions:\\\", trimmed.info.width, trimmed.info.height, \\\"trimOffsetLeft:\\\", trimmed.info.trimOffsetLeft, \\\"trimOffsetTop:\\\", trimmed.info.trimOffsetTop);\\n}\\ncheck();\\n\'\", \"Cwd\":\"/app/applet\", \"IsDaemon\":false, \"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":3000, \"toolAction\":\"Analyzing portrait with sharp\", \"toolSummary\":\"Analyzing image with sharp\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\364\002\n\361\002\001i\024}\023]^/\221\334[\375\203KG\303\254\'?o\033d\316^\342\332i\345\032\315\237YWYg0\r\335~\'\307\016\245U#\263D\265\350\341\336J\217\344^\301X\246OV%\235\206#=r\351\342\274\020{7(\373\362\303\317\274\314\235D \337%\003)n\350\2050w\360y\334M\031)\033\306~\213\250\002\"\333\363\265\303\346\231\313.\305\303e\347l\0204M,\241\250y\037\001\261w\344\036\242\304\365EdZ\202$bQJh\237\n\344\335\347\0274|\213\350\363\336_\246\274q\020Q\207\337\017\241\n\273YA\263\343\210\215\347\322t\275.#.\022\360\306\214\000\312\372t\tKw\301V\267\256\177\231\313~\340n\213j\312!\020\002\f\321\302\322!\215\260[\302G&\315JTY\371\270p%\310\312\363d \347\257\004\261(\371v\022H\354\347Ke\277K\264z\233\263\vhJW%\251\275T\274h\024Nq\230\022i,\315GD\350\345\301\266Y\025\032\340\335\243\205\313\360\373\a\303Za\372\247xc\025\353;*\337\300\224\274\321%\367\023x\204_\377\002\022\241A6\356\230\326\273\346\320y\332\222,x\305!\214m)\305\314\253\315\240\"\357!o\342*\263*\242z\346\337\347\\\210\273\t\022t\2059\374\036\300\317\322\367l5\334d\323I@d\211"
