  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Image Differences**\n\nI\'ve been examining the differences between `crop_test_2280.png` and `crop_test_2400.png`. I\'m focusing on `crop_test_2280.png` now. I\'ve noticed the bottom edge aligns directly with the navel line, just beneath the clasped fingers and wrist. I also just observed a minor clip at the bottom of the hand. I have to see how this impacts my overall understanding.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_24767"
